{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/sendbadges:"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/sendBadges:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"Synchronizes the application badge number with Pushwoosh servers.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"sendBadges:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@NSInteger","text":"NSInteger","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"badge","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"badge","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The current application badge number (0 to clear badge)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reports the current badge count to Pushwoosh for analytics and to enable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"badge-based segmentation. This is useful for:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Analytics"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Track user engagement through unread counts"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Segmentation"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Target users with high\/low badge counts"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Badge management"}]},{"text":": Allow server-side badge manipulation","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call this method whenever you update the app badge to keep Pushwoosh in sync."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Example","level":2,"text":"Example","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sync badge with Pushwoosh when updating unread counts:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["class NotificationBadgeManager {","","    private(set) var unreadCount: Int = 0 {","        didSet {","            updateBadge()","        }","    }","","    func markAsRead(_ notificationIds: [String]) {","        unreadCount = max(0, unreadCount - notificationIds.count)","    }","","    func handleNewNotification() {","        unreadCount += 1","    }","","    func clearAll() {","        unreadCount = 0","    }","","    private func updateBadge() {","        \/\/ Update system badge","        if #available(iOS 16.0, *) {","            UNUserNotificationCenter.current().setBadgeCount(unreadCount)","        } else {","            UIApplication.shared.applicationIconBadgeNumber = unreadCount","        }","","        \/\/ Sync with Pushwoosh","        Pushwoosh.configure.sendBadges(unreadCount)","    }","}","","\/\/ Usage in AppDelegate","class AppDelegate: UIApplicationDelegate {","","    func applicationDidBecomeActive(_ application: UIApplication) {","        \/\/ Sync current badge state when app becomes active","        let currentBadge = application.applicationIconBadgeNumber","        Pushwoosh.configure.sendBadges(currentBadge)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)sendBadges:","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sendBadges:","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"sendBadges:"}],"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"symbolKind":"method","title":"sendBadges:","roleHeading":"Type Method"},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/sendBadges:":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"sendBadges:","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/sendBadges:","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Synchronizes the application badge number with Pushwoosh servers.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/sendbadges:","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sendBadges:","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"sendBadges:"}]},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"abstract":[],"title":"PWConfiguration","fragments":[{"text":"PWConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"type":"topic","title":"PushwooshCore","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore"}}}